{
  "slug": "lean-pm-skills",
  "name": "Lean Pm Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Lean, AI-native product management skills for Claude Code — compress the mechanical PM work into hours and days so you focus on decisions, relationships, and problems worth solving.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **25 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (25): `analytics-insights` (Deep dive into product analytics — investigate a question, surface insights, build a data narrative), `build-vs-buy` (Evaluate whether to build in-house, buy a vendor solution, or partner), `business-case` (Build a complete business case for a product investment — strategic rationale, financial model, risk assessment, and recommendation), `competitive-response` (Assess and respond to a competitor move within 24-48 hours), `discovery-process` (Run a compressed 5-day product discovery cycle), `epic-definition` (Define an epic with strategic context, feature breakdown, milestones, and success metrics), `experiment-design` (Design and run lean experiments — hypothesis, cheapest test, success criteria, decision), `feature-specification` (Write a detailed feature spec with requirements, edge cases, and technical constraints), and 17 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lean-pm-skills@claude-community` from `mrthames/lean-pm-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
